          },
          "text": "🇮🇷How can Europe uphold the courageous work of women who continue to expose the brutal Iranian regime two years after the killing of Jina Mahsa Amini that sparked the Women-Life-Freedom uprising?\nhttps://t.co/TbvuiRsZKc\n\nRegister for the event “The Women, Life, Freedom movement in Iran today”, with a screening of 'When Women Shake the Sky' and direct testimonies from the Iranian activists featured in the film.\n\nAt a time when the EU prides itself as a defender of democracy and equality, the voices of Iranian women remind us that solidarity cannot remain symbolic. \n\nThis is a call for European institutions, policymakers, and civil society to act together — to stand with those who risk everything for freedom, and to safeguard the same values within our own borders.\n\nBy FEPS in collaboration with Institute for Geopolitcal Analyses and Democritus University of Thrace."
